{"id":"forecast-19","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-19/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":485.34,"segments":[{"start":0.75,"end":6.77,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings and you will have to answer questions on what","words":[["You",0.75,1.27],["will",1.27,1.43],["hear",1.43,1.75],["a",1.75,2.09],["number",2.09,2.35],["of",2.35,2.55],["different",2.55,2.91],["recordings",2.91,3.55],["and",3.55,4.43],["you",4.43,4.59],["will",4.59,4.67],["have",4.67,4.85],["to",4.85,4.99],["answer",4.99,5.27],["questions",5.27,5.85],["on",5.85,6.51],["what",6.51,6.77]]},{"start":6.77,"end":7.35,"text":"you hear.","words":[["you",6.77,6.99],["hear.",6.99,7.35]]},{"start":8.21,"end":14.49,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions and you will have a chance to","words":[["There",8.21,8.83],["will",8.83,8.97],["be",8.97,9.15],["time",9.15,9.45],["for",9.45,9.77],["you",9.77,9.91],["to",9.91,10.07],["read",10.07,10.33],["the",10.33,10.53],["instructions",10.53,11.15],["and",11.15,11.77],["questions",11.77,12.27],["and",12.27,13.41],["you",13.41,13.55],["will",13.55,13.65],["have",13.65,13.81],["a",13.81,13.95],["chance",13.95,14.27],["to",14.27,14.49]]},{"start":14.49,"end":15.51,"text":"check your work.","words":[["check",14.49,14.85],["your",14.85,15.13],["work.",15.13,15.51]]},{"start":16.61,"end":19.73,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",16.61,17.15],["the",17.15,17.29],["recordings",17.29,17.69],["will",17.69,18.07],["be",18.07,18.25],["played",18.25,18.63],["once",18.63,19.09],["only.",19.09,19.73]]},{"start":20.77,"end":22.97,"text":"The test is in four sections.","words":[["The",20.77,21.25],["test",21.25,21.71],["is",21.71,22.01],["in",22.01,22.21],["four",22.21,22.45],["sections.",22.45,22.97]]},{"start":23.93,"end":27.29,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",23.93,24.33],["all",24.33,24.63],["your",24.63,24.75],["answers",24.75,25.25],["in",25.25,25.69],["the",25.69,25.85],["listening",25.85,26.17],["question",26.17,26.81],["booklet.",26.81,27.29]]},{"start":27.29,"end":34.13,"text":"At the end of the test you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an answer","words":[["At",27.29,28.21],["the",28.21,28.73],["end",28.73,28.93],["of",28.93,29.05],["the",29.05,29.13],["test",29.13,29.51],["you",29.51,30.29],["will",30.29,30.43],["be",30.43,30.59],["given",30.59,30.79],["10",30.79,31.19],["minutes",31.19,31.43],["to",31.43,31.99],["transfer",31.99,32.63],["your",32.63,32.91],["answers",32.91,33.39],["to",33.39,33.69],["an",33.69,33.85],["answer",33.85,34.13]]},{"start":34.13,"end":34.47,"text":"sheet.","words":[["sheet.",34.13,34.47]]},{"start":36.57,"end":41.55,"text":"Now turn to section 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",36.57,36.99],["turn",36.99,37.29],["to",37.29,37.49],["section",37.49,37.79],["1",37.79,38.29],["on",38.29,38.95],["page",38.95,39.29],["2",39.29,39.87],["of",39.87,40.45],["your",40.45,40.63],["question",40.63,41.05],["booklet.",41.05,41.55]]},{"start":46.7,"end":47.66,"text":"Section 1.","words":[["Section",46.7,47.16],["1.",47.16,47.66]]},{"start":48.62,"end":54.9,"text":"You will hear a telephone conversation between a representative of a moving company and","words":[["You",48.62,48.96],["will",48.96,49.14],["hear",49.14,49.36],["a",49.36,49.62],["telephone",49.62,49.98],["conversation",49.98,50.92],["between",50.92,51.74],["a",51.74,52.02],["representative",52.02,52.62],["of",52.62,53.2],["a",53.2,53.32],["moving",53.32,53.54],["company",53.54,54.14],["and",54.14,54.9]]},{"start":54.9,"end":55.44,"text":"a customer.","words":[["a",54.9,55.06],["customer.",55.06,55.44]]},{"start":56.36,"end":61.82,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 3 on page 2.","words":[["First,",56.36,56.84],["you",57.26,57.42],["have",57.42,57.58],["some",57.58,57.76],["time",57.76,58.18],["to",58.18,58.6],["look",58.6,58.74],["at",58.74,58.86],["questions",58.86,59.18],["1",59.18,59.76],["to",59.76,60.1],["3",60.1,60.54],["on",60.54,60.98],["page",60.98,61.28],["2.",61.28,61.82]]},{"start":61.82,"end":95.54,"text":"You will see that there is an example that has been done for you.","words":[["You",61.82,62.6],["will",92.42,92.6],["see",92.6,92.88],["that",92.88,93.1],["there",93.1,93.26],["is",93.26,93.4],["an",93.4,93.52],["example",93.52,94.04],["that",94.04,94.28],["has",94.28,94.42],["been",94.42,94.62],["done",94.62,94.88],["for",94.88,95.26],["you.",95.26,95.54]]},{"start":96.2,"end":101.96,"text":"On this occasion only, the conversation relating to this will be played first.","words":[["On",96.2,96.46],["this",96.46,96.82],["occasion",96.82,97.36],["only,",97.36,97.94],["the",98.5,98.72],["conversation",98.72,99.24],["relating",99.24,99.86],["to",99.86,100.2],["this",100.2,100.46],["will",100.46,100.9],["be",100.9,101.08],["played",101.08,101.56],["first.",101.56,101.96]]},{"start":105.6,"end":108.64,"text":"Good morning. Interstate moves made easy. Can I help you?","words":[["Good",105.6,105.82],["morning.",105.82,106.14],["Interstate",106.42,106.8],["moves",106.8,107.12],["made",107.12,107.42],["easy.",107.42,107.78],["Can",108.04,108.1],["I",108.1,108.2],["help",108.2,108.38],["you?",108.38,108.64]]},{"start":109.06,"end":115.18,"text":"Yes. My husband is being transferred to Sydney and I'm wondering if you could help me find suitable rental accommodation.","words":[["Yes.",109.06,109.4],["My",109.7,109.84],["husband",109.84,110.14],["is",110.14,110.38],["being",110.38,110.58],["transferred",110.58,111.02],["to",111.02,111.38],["Sydney",111.38,111.72],["and",111.72,112.12],["I'm",112.12,112.38],["wondering",112.38,112.7],["if",112.7,112.92],["you",112.92,113.02],["could",113.02,113.16],["help",113.16,113.34],["me",113.34,113.48],["find",113.48,113.74],["suitable",113.74,114.08],["rental",114.08,114.5],["accommodation.",114.5,115.18]]},{"start":115.74,"end":120.02,"text":"Certainly. Now let me just get a form then I can get some details.","words":[["Certainly.",115.74,116.3],["Now",117.0,117.18],["let",117.18,117.34],["me",117.34,117.46],["just",117.46,117.68],["get",117.68,117.84],["a",117.84,117.98],["form",117.98,118.46],["then",118.46,118.74],["I",118.74,118.9],["can",118.9,119.06],["get",119.06,119.22],["some",119.22,119.46],["details.",119.46,120.02]]},{"start":121.76,"end":123.48,"text":"Can you give me a name please?","words":[["Can",121.76,122.32],["you",122.32,122.48],["give",122.48,122.64],["me",122.64,122.76],["a",122.76,122.88],["name",122.88,123.16],["please?",123.16,123.48]]},{"start":123.48,"end":125.88,"text":"Yes, it's Ann Jones.","words":[["Yes,",123.48,124.24],["it's",124.54,124.9],["Ann",124.9,125.28],["Jones.",125.28,125.88]]},{"start":129.38,"end":135.92,"text":"The customer's name is Ann Jones, so Jones has been written in the space.","words":[["The",129.38,129.68],["customer's",129.68,130.4],["name",130.4,130.78],["is",130.78,131.34],["Ann",131.34,131.86],["Jones,",131.86,132.46],["so",132.86,133.16],["Jones",133.16,134.06],["has",134.06,134.8],["been",134.8,135.0],["written",135.0,135.24],["in",135.24,135.44],["the",135.44,135.56],["space.",135.56,135.92]]},{"start":137.58,"end":138.74,"text":"Now we shall begin.","words":[["Now",137.58,137.86],["we",137.86,138.12],["shall",138.12,138.34],["begin.",138.34,138.74]]},{"start":139.72,"end":145.36,"text":"You should answer the questions as you listen because you will not hear the recording a second time.","words":[["You",139.72,139.92],["should",139.92,140.12],["answer",140.12,140.4],["the",140.4,140.6],["questions",140.6,141.04],["as",141.04,141.42],["you",141.42,141.66],["listen",141.66,142.08],["because",142.08,142.82],["you",142.82,143.02],["will",143.02,143.14],["not",143.14,143.34],["hear",143.34,143.62],["the",143.62,143.76],["recording",143.76,144.2],["a",144.2,144.52],["second",144.52,144.8],["time.",144.8,145.36]]},{"start":146.48,"end":150.42,"text":"Listen carefully and answer questions one to three.","words":[["Listen",146.48,147.12],["carefully",147.12,147.6],["and",147.6,148.42],["answer",148.42,148.76],["questions",148.76,149.22],["one",149.22,149.64],["to",149.64,150.0],["three.",150.0,150.42]]},{"start":153.85,"end":156.91,"text":"Good morning. Interstate moves made easy. Can I help you?","words":[["Good",153.85,154.09],["morning.",154.09,154.39],["Interstate",154.71,155.05],["moves",155.05,155.37],["made",155.37,155.71],["easy.",155.71,156.09],["Can",156.25,156.35],["I",156.35,156.47],["help",156.47,156.65],["you?",156.65,156.91]]},{"start":156.91,"end":161.43,"text":"Yes my husband is being transferred to Sydney and I'm wondering if you could","words":[["Yes",156.91,157.63],["my",157.63,158.09],["husband",158.09,158.41],["is",158.41,158.65],["being",158.65,158.85],["transferred",158.85,159.31],["to",159.31,159.65],["Sydney",159.65,159.97],["and",159.97,160.37],["I'm",160.37,160.65],["wondering",160.65,160.97],["if",160.97,161.19],["you",161.19,161.29],["could",161.29,161.43]]},{"start":161.43,"end":166.25,"text":"help me find suitable rental accommodation. Certainly. Now let me just get a","words":[["help",161.43,161.59],["me",161.59,161.75],["find",161.75,162.01],["suitable",162.01,162.35],["rental",162.35,162.77],["accommodation.",162.77,163.45],["Certainly.",164.07,164.63],["Now",165.29,165.45],["let",165.45,165.61],["me",165.61,165.73],["just",165.73,165.95],["get",165.95,166.11],["a",166.11,166.25]]},{"start":166.25,"end":173.51,"text":"form then I can get some details. Can you give me a name please? Yes it's Anne","words":[["form",166.25,166.73],["then",166.73,167.03],["I",167.03,167.17],["can",167.17,167.33],["get",167.33,167.49],["some",167.49,167.71],["details.",167.71,168.31],["Can",170.07,170.57],["you",170.57,170.75],["give",170.75,170.89],["me",170.89,171.03],["a",171.03,171.13],["name",171.13,171.41],["please?",171.41,171.77],["Yes",172.31,172.57],["it's",172.57,173.25],["Anne",173.25,173.51]]},{"start":173.51,"end":182.07,"text":"Jones. And what's your number at home? 66218047. And do you have a mobile","words":[["Jones.",173.51,174.17],["And",174.53,174.77],["what's",174.77,175.15],["your",175.15,175.29],["number",175.29,175.57],["at",175.57,175.75],["home?",175.75,176.05],["66218047.",179.83,180.39],["And",180.87,181.31],["do",181.31,181.49],["you",181.49,181.57],["have",181.57,181.71],["a",181.71,181.83],["mobile",181.83,182.07]]},{"start":182.69,"end":191.13,"text":"No, but I can give you my work number. It's 0-4-2-7-1-3-9-6-8-4.","words":[["No,",182.69,183.31],["but",183.77,183.95],["I",183.95,184.19],["can",184.19,184.41],["give",184.41,184.63],["you",184.63,184.75],["my",184.75,184.89],["work",184.89,185.19],["number.",185.19,185.53],["It's",186.11,186.51],["0",186.51,186.83],["-4",186.83,187.27],["-2",187.27,187.67],["-7",187.67,188.17],["-1",188.17,188.79],["-3",188.79,189.17],["-9",189.17,189.59],["-6",189.59,190.29],["-8",190.29,190.67],["-4.",190.67,191.13]]},{"start":191.67,"end":195.39,"text":"Fine. And you said you were planning to move to Sydney. Is that right?","words":[["Fine.",191.67,192.23],["And",192.69,192.95],["you",192.95,193.11],["said",193.11,193.23],["you",193.23,193.37],["were",193.37,193.45],["planning",193.45,193.67],["to",193.67,193.89],["move",193.89,194.11],["to",194.11,194.33],["Sydney.",194.33,194.81],["Is",195.01,195.05],["that",195.05,195.15],["right?",195.15,195.39]]},{"start":195.81,"end":196.09,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",195.81,196.09]]},{"start":196.43,"end":201.03,"text":"Oh, how exciting. It's a lovely city. And where are you living now?","words":[["Oh,",196.43,196.77],["how",196.91,196.97],["exciting.",196.97,197.45],["It's",197.87,198.01],["a",198.01,198.13],["lovely",198.13,198.33],["city.",198.33,198.73],["And",199.21,199.71],["where",199.71,200.09],["are",200.09,200.25],["you",200.25,200.35],["living",200.35,200.57],["now?",200.57,201.03]]},{"start":201.55,"end":205.35,"text":"We're over in Western Australia in a place called Summiton.","words":[["We're",201.55,201.97],["over",201.97,202.33],["in",202.33,202.61],["Western",202.61,202.91],["Australia",202.91,203.51],["in",203.51,204.01],["a",204.01,204.17],["place",204.17,204.43],["called",204.43,204.73],["Summiton.",204.73,205.35]]},{"start":205.73,"end":206.89,"text":"Can you spell that please?","words":[["Can",205.73,205.97],["you",205.97,206.09],["spell",206.09,206.41],["that",206.41,206.59],["please?",206.59,206.89]]},{"start":206.89,"end":212.33,"text":"Yes, it's S-O-M-E-R-T-O-N.","words":[["Yes,",206.89,207.79],["it's",208.07,208.39],["S",208.39,208.77],["-O",208.77,209.17],["-M",209.17,209.75],["-E",209.75,210.23],["-R",210.23,210.87],["-T",210.87,211.21],["-O",211.21,211.85],["-N.",211.85,212.33]]},{"start":212.83,"end":214.85,"text":"That's going to be a big move for you, isn't it?","words":[["That's",212.83,213.13],["going",213.13,213.27],["to",213.27,213.35],["be",213.35,213.49],["a",213.49,213.61],["big",213.61,213.75],["move",213.75,214.03],["for",214.03,214.29],["you,",214.29,214.45],["isn't",214.51,214.67],["it?",214.67,214.85]]},{"start":215.13,"end":221.39,"text":"Yes. Well, we've been here in Western Australia for a few years now, so it seems like a good time to move.","words":[["Yes.",215.13,215.47],["Well,",215.83,216.09],["we've",216.19,216.45],["been",216.45,216.61],["here",216.61,216.87],["in",216.87,217.05],["Western",217.05,217.27],["Australia",217.27,217.81],["for",217.81,218.09],["a",218.09,218.25],["few",218.25,218.41],["years",218.41,218.85],["now,",218.85,219.15],["so",219.25,219.55],["it",219.55,220.05],["seems",220.05,220.27],["like",220.27,220.47],["a",220.47,220.59],["good",220.59,220.71],["time",220.71,220.95],["to",220.95,221.13],["move.",221.13,221.39]]},{"start":222.03,"end":225.57,"text":"Okay, so it's you, your husband and any children?","words":[["Okay,",222.03,222.53],["so",222.65,222.85],["it's",222.85,222.99],["you,",222.99,223.31],["your",223.45,223.55],["husband",223.55,223.93],["and",223.93,224.81],["any",224.81,225.25],["children?",225.25,225.57]]},{"start":225.89,"end":230.99,"text":"Yes, just one child, Ben. He's two, but he's going to be three next week.","words":[["Yes,",225.89,226.23],["just",226.41,226.61],["one",226.61,226.93],["child,",226.93,227.37],["Ben.",227.77,227.89],["He's",228.33,228.75],["two,",228.75,229.07],["but",229.49,229.65],["he's",229.65,229.83],["going",229.83,229.97],["to",229.97,230.07],["be",230.07,230.19],["three",230.19,230.43],["next",230.43,230.71],["week.",230.71,230.99]]},{"start":231.29,"end":231.75,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",231.29,231.75]]},{"start":231.75,"end":241.54,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 4-10","words":[["Before",231.75,232.87],["you",235.56,235.88],["hear",235.88,236.08],["the",236.08,236.24],["rest",236.24,236.52],["of",236.52,236.64],["the",236.64,236.72],["conversation,",236.72,237.34],["you",238.0,238.28],["have",238.28,238.46],["some",238.46,238.64],["time",238.64,239.04],["to",239.04,239.56],["look",239.56,239.7],["at",239.7,239.82],["questions",239.82,240.18],["4",240.18,240.88],["-10",240.88,241.54]]},{"start":241.54,"end":276.74,"text":"on page 2. Now listen and answer questions 4-10.","words":[["on",241.54,241.94],["page",241.94,242.24],["2.",242.24,242.82],["Now",273.12,273.48],["listen",273.48,273.82],["and",273.82,274.36],["answer",274.36,274.72],["questions",274.72,275.26],["4",275.26,275.9],["-10.",275.9,276.74]]},{"start":280.36,"end":285.56,"text":"Right, so let's think about accommodation first of all. What kind of place are you looking","words":[["Right,",280.36,280.78],["so",281.22,281.58],["let's",281.58,282.0],["think",282.0,282.18],["about",282.18,282.48],["accommodation",282.48,283.18],["first",283.18,283.7],["of",283.7,283.96],["all.",283.96,284.14],["What",284.5,284.64],["kind",284.64,284.78],["of",284.78,284.88],["place",284.88,285.08],["are",285.08,285.3],["you",285.3,285.34],["looking",285.34,285.56]]},{"start":285.56,"end":288.88,"text":"for? Presumably something large enough for your whole family.","words":[["for?",285.56,285.96],["Presumably",286.32,286.88],["something",286.88,287.24],["large",287.24,287.7],["enough",287.7,287.94],["for",287.94,288.14],["your",288.14,288.24],["whole",288.24,288.42],["family.",288.42,288.88]]},{"start":289.36,"end":294.06,"text":"Yes, we're in a lovely big house at the moment but I realise we won't be able to","words":[["Yes,",289.36,289.86],["we're",290.1,290.4],["in",290.4,290.58],["a",290.58,290.7],["lovely",290.7,291.06],["big",291.06,291.3],["house",291.3,291.62],["at",291.62,291.78],["the",291.78,291.84],["moment",291.84,292.24],["but",292.24,292.56],["I",292.56,292.76],["realise",292.76,293.12],["we",293.12,293.38],["won't",293.38,293.68],["be",293.68,293.78],["able",293.78,293.96],["to",293.96,294.06]]},{"start":294.06,"end":299.06,"text":"afford that in Sydney so I'd be happy in a flat but as long as there is enough","words":[["afford",294.06,294.32],["that",294.32,294.58],["in",294.58,294.74],["Sydney",294.74,295.04],["so",295.04,295.92],["I'd",295.92,296.36],["be",296.36,296.5],["happy",296.5,296.84],["in",296.84,297.0],["a",297.0,297.1],["flat",297.1,297.32],["but",297.32,297.74],["as",297.74,297.98],["long",297.98,298.22],["as",298.22,298.42],["there",298.42,298.64],["is",298.64,298.86],["enough",298.86,299.06]]},{"start":299.06,"end":304.56,"text":"space. Yes I think it's a lot easier to find a flat here at the moment. Do you have","words":[["space.",299.06,299.42],["Yes",299.82,300.14],["I",300.14,300.68],["think",300.68,300.86],["it's",300.86,301.04],["a",301.04,301.14],["lot",301.14,301.26],["easier",301.26,301.6],["to",301.6,301.8],["find",301.8,302.08],["a",302.08,302.24],["flat",302.24,302.52],["here",302.52,302.9],["at",302.9,303.02],["the",303.02,303.1],["moment.",303.1,303.48],["Do",303.9,304.3],["you",304.3,304.42],["have",304.42,304.56]]},{"start":304.56,"end":308.7,"text":"any idea what sort of area you'd like to be in? I'd prefer the north to the south","words":[["any",304.56,304.74],["idea",304.74,305.08],["what",305.08,305.3],["sort",305.3,305.56],["of",305.56,305.68],["area",305.68,305.94],["you'd",305.94,306.2],["like",306.2,306.34],["to",306.34,306.52],["be",306.52,306.64],["in?",306.64,306.82],["I'd",307.02,307.22],["prefer",307.22,307.44],["the",307.44,307.62],["north",307.62,307.92],["to",307.92,308.12],["the",308.12,308.26],["south",308.26,308.7]]},{"start":308.7,"end":313.04,"text":"but I've heard it's a lot more expensive is that right? Yes it can be more","words":[["but",308.7,309.0],["I've",309.0,309.32],["heard",309.32,309.5],["it's",309.5,309.7],["a",309.7,309.78],["lot",309.78,309.92],["more",309.92,310.06],["expensive",310.06,310.6],["is",310.6,310.88],["that",310.88,311.02],["right?",311.02,311.26],["Yes",311.78,312.12],["it",312.12,312.38],["can",312.38,312.66],["be",312.66,312.84],["more",312.84,313.04]]},{"start":313.04,"end":317.92,"text":"expensive but there are some lovely flats there. Well that would be my","words":[["expensive",313.04,313.68],["but",313.68,314.48],["there",314.48,314.66],["are",314.66,314.78],["some",314.78,315.08],["lovely",315.08,315.48],["flats",315.48,315.84],["there.",315.84,316.28],["Well",316.82,317.22],["that",317.22,317.52],["would",317.52,317.64],["be",317.64,317.76],["my",317.76,317.92]]},{"start":317.92,"end":322.72,"text":"first choice then. Great and how many bedrooms do you want? Well there are","words":[["first",317.92,318.18],["choice",318.18,318.52],["then.",318.52,318.8],["Great",319.22,319.6],["and",319.6,320.26],["how",320.26,320.5],["many",320.5,320.66],["bedrooms",320.66,321.06],["do",321.06,321.4],["you",321.4,321.46],["want?",321.46,321.72],["Well",322.1,322.44],["there",322.44,322.62],["are",322.62,322.72]]},{"start":322.72,"end":327.0,"text":"only three of us but I would like an extra room for visitors and one for an","words":[["only",322.72,323.04],["three",323.04,323.32],["of",323.32,323.52],["us",323.52,323.76],["but",323.76,324.0],["I",324.0,324.12],["would",324.12,324.36],["like",324.36,324.58],["an",324.58,324.7],["extra",324.7,325.0],["room",325.0,325.32],["for",325.32,325.5],["visitors",325.5,325.86],["and",325.86,326.44],["one",326.44,326.66],["for",326.66,326.88],["an",326.88,327.0]]},{"start":327.0,"end":333.64,"text":"office so four would be great. Of course. Now what about special facilities? Is there","words":[["office",327.0,327.2],["so",327.2,327.76],["four",327.76,328.18],["would",328.18,328.36],["be",328.36,328.48],["great.",328.48,328.82],["Of",329.48,329.7],["course.",329.7,330.06],["Now",330.6,330.88],["what",330.88,331.2],["about",331.2,331.42],["special",331.42,331.92],["facilities?",331.92,332.72],["Is",333.34,333.52],["there",333.52,333.64]]},{"start":333.64,"end":338.0,"text":"anything that you particularly require? Well of course we'll miss our big garden","words":[["anything",333.64,333.94],["that",333.94,334.18],["you",334.18,334.26],["particularly",334.26,334.8],["require?",334.8,335.48],["Well",335.94,336.26],["of",336.26,336.4],["course",336.4,336.68],["we'll",336.68,336.92],["miss",336.92,337.14],["our",337.14,337.32],["big",337.32,337.48],["garden",337.48,338.0]]},{"start":338.0,"end":342.58,"text":"and I realise that is out of the question but it has to be near a park.","words":[["and",338.0,338.42],["I",338.42,338.64],["realise",338.64,339.04],["that",339.04,339.74],["is",339.74,339.92],["out",339.92,340.08],["of",340.08,340.18],["the",340.18,340.26],["question",340.26,340.62],["but",340.62,341.26],["it",341.26,341.44],["has",341.44,341.72],["to",341.72,341.88],["be",341.88,342.0],["near",342.0,342.12],["a",342.12,342.28],["park.",342.28,342.58]]},{"start":343.2,"end":347.68,"text":"Okay I'll put that on the form and is there anything else? What about a","words":[["Okay",343.2,343.68],["I'll",343.68,344.0],["put",344.0,344.14],["that",344.14,344.32],["on",344.32,344.48],["the",344.48,344.6],["form",344.6,345.06],["and",345.06,345.88],["is",345.88,346.04],["there",346.04,346.16],["anything",346.16,346.36],["else?",346.36,346.74],["What",347.24,347.42],["about",347.42,347.56],["a",347.56,347.68]]},{"start":347.68,"end":351.44,"text":"shopping centre? I'm not much of a shopper but we're very keen on keeping","words":[["shopping",347.68,347.94],["centre?",347.94,348.34],["I'm",348.76,348.98],["not",348.98,349.12],["much",349.12,349.38],["of",349.38,349.5],["a",349.5,349.62],["shopper",349.62,350.04],["but",350.04,350.32],["we're",350.32,350.56],["very",350.56,350.78],["keen",350.78,351.1],["on",351.1,351.24],["keeping",351.24,351.44]]},{"start":351.44,"end":356.26,"text":"fit and I'm teaching Ben to swim so a pool would be great. Would that be possible?","words":[["fit",351.44,351.78],["and",351.78,352.3],["I'm",352.3,352.52],["teaching",352.52,352.8],["Ben",352.8,353.12],["to",353.12,353.28],["swim",353.28,353.58],["so",353.58,353.94],["a",353.94,354.26],["pool",354.26,354.48],["would",354.48,354.66],["be",354.66,354.78],["great.",354.78,355.02],["Would",355.44,355.58],["that",355.58,355.76],["be",355.76,355.9],["possible?",355.9,356.26]]},{"start":356.68,"end":361.26,"text":"Well it all depends on how much you're prepared to pay but I'll put it down as","words":[["Well",356.68,356.96],["it",356.96,357.26],["all",357.26,357.38],["depends",357.38,357.64],["on",357.64,357.92],["how",357.92,358.14],["much",358.14,358.44],["you're",358.44,358.64],["prepared",358.64,358.86],["to",358.86,359.12],["pay",359.12,359.5],["but",359.5,360.4],["I'll",360.4,360.58],["put",360.58,360.7],["it",360.7,360.82],["down",360.82,361.1],["as",361.1,361.26]]},{"start":361.26,"end":366.36,"text":"one of your requirements anyway. Now what about rent? How much do you want to spend","words":[["one",361.26,361.38],["of",361.38,361.44],["your",361.44,361.58],["requirements",361.58,362.02],["anyway.",362.02,362.46],["Now",363.48,363.66],["what",363.66,364.02],["about",364.02,364.28],["rent?",364.28,364.8],["How",365.24,365.44],["much",365.44,365.62],["do",365.62,365.78],["you",365.78,365.84],["want",365.84,365.96],["to",365.96,366.08],["spend",366.08,366.36]]},{"start":366.36,"end":370.96,"text":"per week? What sort of prices are properties like these? Usually in the","words":[["per",366.36,366.74],["week?",366.74,367.02],["What",367.5,367.68],["sort",367.68,367.86],["of",367.86,368.0],["prices",368.0,368.4],["are",368.4,368.7],["properties",368.7,369.08],["like",369.08,369.4],["these?",369.4,369.7],["Usually",370.24,370.66],["in",370.66,370.88],["the",370.88,370.96]]},{"start":370.96,"end":378.06,"text":"region of $500 and up to $1,000 for the really luxurious ones but I'd say","words":[["region",370.96,371.28],["of",371.28,371.5],["$500",371.5,372.4],["and",372.4,373.7],["up",373.7,373.92],["to",373.92,374.08],["$1",374.08,374.46],[",000",374.46,374.9],["for",374.9,375.38],["the",375.38,375.48],["really",375.48,375.78],["luxurious",375.78,376.18],["ones",376.18,376.78],["but",376.78,377.54],["I'd",377.54,377.78],["say",377.78,378.06]]},{"start":378.06,"end":383.02,"text":"say for $650 a week you could get a really nice flat with everything you want.","words":[["say",378.06,378.18],["for",378.18,378.38],["$650",378.38,379.32],["a",379.32,379.82],["week",379.82,380.1],["you",380.1,380.4],["could",380.4,380.56],["get",380.56,380.68],["a",380.68,380.78],["really",380.78,381.04],["nice",381.04,381.42],["flat",381.42,381.78],["with",381.78,382.0],["everything",382.0,382.5],["you",382.5,382.68],["want.",382.68,383.02]]},{"start":383.3,"end":385.4,"text":"Okay, let's say up to that then.","words":[["Okay,",383.3,383.74],["let's",384.1,384.42],["say",384.42,384.64],["up",384.64,384.86],["to",384.86,384.98],["that",384.98,385.16],["then.",385.16,385.4]]},{"start":385.74,"end":389.82,"text":"Great. Now last of all, when are you planning to move over here?","words":[["Great.",385.74,386.1],["Now",386.76,387.02],["last",387.02,387.42],["of",387.42,387.6],["all,",387.6,387.84],["when",388.12,388.44],["are",388.44,388.58],["you",388.58,388.68],["planning",388.68,388.92],["to",388.92,389.16],["move",389.16,389.3],["over",389.3,389.58],["here?",389.58,389.82]]},{"start":390.28,"end":394.54,"text":"We're fairly flexible about when we get over there but we've got to move out of our house","words":[["We're",390.28,390.58],["fairly",390.58,390.8],["flexible",390.8,391.16],["about",391.16,391.5],["when",391.5,391.76],["we",391.76,391.9],["get",391.9,392.06],["over",392.06,392.32],["there",392.32,392.58],["but",392.58,392.8],["we've",392.8,393.1],["got",393.1,393.26],["to",393.26,393.46],["move",393.46,393.64],["out",393.64,393.92],["of",393.92,394.02],["our",394.02,394.14],["house",394.14,394.54]]},{"start":394.54,"end":399.56,"text":"by 1st of December. We're planning on travelling around a little to visit friends and family","words":[["by",394.54,394.88],["1st",394.88,395.34],["of",395.34,395.42],["December.",395.42,395.76],["We're",396.32,396.62],["planning",396.62,396.88],["on",396.88,397.06],["travelling",397.06,397.36],["around",397.36,397.7],["a",397.7,397.96],["little",397.96,398.1],["to",398.1,398.28],["visit",398.28,398.48],["friends",398.48,398.92],["and",398.92,399.12],["family",399.12,399.56]]},{"start":399.56,"end":404.44,"text":"but we would definitely like to move into our new house by December 15th, ready for Christmas.","words":[["but",399.56,399.9],["we",399.9,400.16],["would",400.16,400.32],["definitely",400.32,400.74],["like",400.74,401.14],["to",401.14,401.32],["move",401.32,401.48],["into",401.48,401.68],["our",401.68,401.84],["new",401.84,401.98],["house",401.98,402.28],["by",402.28,402.54],["December",402.54,402.82],["15th,",402.82,403.76],["ready",403.76,404.02],["for",404.02,404.18],["Christmas.",404.18,404.44]]},{"start":404.92,"end":407.4,"text":"Right, I'll put that down as your moving date.","words":[["Right,",404.92,405.38],["I'll",405.6,405.8],["put",405.8,405.94],["that",405.94,406.16],["down",406.16,406.42],["as",406.42,406.56],["your",406.56,406.7],["moving",406.7,406.96],["date.",406.96,407.4]]},{"start":407.4,"end":408.9,"text":"We can always alter it later.","words":[["We",407.4,407.78],["can",407.78,407.9],["always",407.9,408.1],["alter",408.1,408.44],["it",408.44,408.6],["later.",408.6,408.9]]},{"start":409.62,"end":411.0,"text":"Is there anything else I can do?","words":[["Is",409.62,409.76],["there",409.76,409.9],["anything",409.9,410.18],["else",410.18,410.42],["I",410.42,410.58],["can",410.58,410.74],["do?",410.74,411.0]]},{"start":411.44,"end":413.5,"text":"Obviously you don't need to find a school yet.","words":[["Obviously",411.44,411.8],["you",411.8,412.08],["don't",412.08,412.3],["need",412.3,412.46],["to",412.46,412.64],["find",412.64,412.78],["a",412.78,412.92],["school",412.92,413.18],["yet.",413.18,413.5]]},{"start":413.84,"end":416.7,"text":"No, but I'd like to fly to Sydney next month","words":[["No,",413.84,414.16],["but",414.44,414.72],["I'd",414.72,414.92],["like",414.92,415.08],["to",415.08,415.38],["fly",415.38,415.7],["to",415.7,415.84],["Sydney",415.84,416.06],["next",416.06,416.34],["month",416.34,416.7]]},{"start":416.7,"end":419.06,"text":"on the 31st of August to check out some properties.","words":[["on",416.7,416.94],["the",416.94,417.04],["31st",417.04,417.56],["of",417.56,417.64],["August",417.64,417.88],["to",417.88,418.14],["check",418.14,418.36],["out",418.36,418.52],["some",418.52,418.72],["properties.",418.72,419.06]]},{"start":419.48,"end":420.72,"text":"That's a great idea.","words":[["That's",419.48,419.8],["a",419.8,419.92],["great",419.92,420.22],["idea.",420.22,420.72]]},{"start":421.18,"end":423.8,"text":"Would you like me to book your flight or a hotel for you?","words":[["Would",421.18,421.34],["you",421.34,421.48],["like",421.48,421.66],["me",421.66,421.8],["to",421.8,421.92],["book",421.92,422.08],["your",422.08,422.28],["flight",422.28,422.62],["or",422.62,422.92],["a",422.92,423.02],["hotel",423.02,423.3],["for",423.3,423.62],["you?",423.62,423.8]]},{"start":424.06,"end":425.64,"text":"Actually, I've already booked my flight,","words":[["Actually,",424.06,424.4],["I've",424.52,424.7],["already",424.7,424.94],["booked",424.94,425.16],["my",425.16,425.32],["flight,",425.32,425.64]]},{"start":425.7,"end":426.9,"text":"but we do need a hotel.","words":[["but",425.7,425.82],["we",425.82,426.02],["do",426.02,426.24],["need",426.24,426.42],["a",426.42,426.52],["hotel.",426.52,426.9]]},{"start":427.42,"end":429.28,"text":"Somewhere near to the properties would be great.","words":[["Somewhere",427.42,427.78],["near",427.78,428.04],["to",428.04,428.18],["the",428.18,428.28],["properties",428.28,428.56],["would",428.56,428.82],["be",428.82,428.96],["great.",428.96,429.28]]},{"start":429.76,"end":432.04,"text":"I'll be travelling with Ben and we'll just stay overnight.","words":[["I'll",429.76,430.02],["be",430.02,430.12],["travelling",430.12,430.38],["with",430.38,430.62],["Ben",430.62,430.8],["and",430.8,431.0],["we'll",431.0,431.18],["just",431.18,431.38],["stay",431.38,431.64],["overnight.",431.64,432.04]]},{"start":432.46,"end":435.2,"text":"That's fine. I'll organise that as soon as I can.","words":[["That's",432.46,432.94],["fine.",432.94,433.26],["I'll",433.68,433.84],["organise",433.84,434.06],["that",434.06,434.38],["as",434.38,434.52],["soon",434.52,434.7],["as",434.7,434.8],["I",434.8,434.96],["can.",434.96,435.2]]},{"start":435.2,"end":437.74,"text":"Well, I look forward to seeing you soon, Anne.","words":[["Well,",435.2,435.96],["I",436.14,436.2],["look",436.2,436.34],["forward",436.34,436.56],["to",436.56,436.72],["seeing",436.72,436.98],["you",436.98,437.1],["soon,",437.1,437.48],["Anne.",437.52,437.74]]},{"start":441.26,"end":443.0,"text":"That is the end of section 1.","words":[["That",441.26,441.64],["is",441.64,441.8],["the",441.8,441.94],["end",441.94,442.16],["of",442.16,442.28],["section",442.28,442.56],["1.",442.56,443.0]]},{"start":443.92,"end":446.6,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",443.92,444.1],["now",444.1,444.32],["have",444.32,444.58],["half",444.58,444.84],["a",444.84,444.98],["minute",444.98,445.18],["to",445.18,445.56],["check",445.56,445.86],["your",445.86,446.12],["answers.",446.12,446.6]]},{"start":477.05,"end":480.25,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",477.05,477.33],["turn",477.33,477.63],["to",477.63,477.81],["section",477.81,478.15],["2",478.15,478.71],["on",478.71,479.39],["page",479.39,479.73],["3.",479.73,480.25]]}]}